    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price of a Life</strong> is a unique, single-player experience blending intense bullet-hell gameplay with strategic micromanagement. Set in a  hedonistic world, you must compete fiercely to earn the favor of the enigmatic deity, Sacrion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Sacrion's Trials:</strong> Navigate chaotic trials filled with relentless enemies and lethal projectiles. Combine quick reflexes and strategic planning to adapt and survive, proving yourself worthy of Sacrion's attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay:</strong> Control multiple elements simultaneously, blending precision mouse and keyboard controls with tactical decision-making. Balance managing characters, dodging bullet storms, and maintaining order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide Your Team:</strong> Lead two brave boys through perilous dangers, with strategic support from a wise monk whose advice might just be your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Art &amp; Original Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in a beautifully hand-drawn art style complemented by an original soundtrack that brings Sacrion's treacherous world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Awaits:</strong> Face varied and unpredictable obstacles and fierce enemies. Do you have what it takes to conquer the trials, impress Sacrion, and voice your ultimate wish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace chaos, manage carefully, and discover if the price of a life is one you're willing to pay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price of a Life</strong> is a unique, single-player experience blending intense bullet-hell gameplay with strategic micromanagement. Set in a  hedonistic world, you must compete fiercely to earn the favor of the enigmatic deity, Sacrion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Sacrion's Trials:</strong> Navigate chaotic trials filled with relentless enemies and lethal projectiles. Combine quick reflexes and strategic planning to adapt and survive, proving yourself worthy of Sacrion's attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay:</strong> Control multiple elements simultaneously, blending precision mouse and keyboard controls with tactical decision-making. Balance managing characters, dodging bullet storms, and maintaining order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide Your Team:</strong> Lead two brave boys through perilous dangers, with strategic support from a wise monk whose advice might just be your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Art &amp; Original Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in a beautifully hand-drawn art style complemented by an original soundtrack that brings Sacrion's treacherous world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Awaits:</strong> Face varied and unpredictable obstacles and fierce enemies. Do you have what it takes to conquer the trials, impress Sacrion, and voice your ultimate wish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace chaos, manage carefully, and discover if the price of a life is one you're willing to pay.</p>",
